yɛn Ɔhene, to ayɛyie nnwom.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn yɛ asase nyinaa so Ɔhene.","poem":1},{"text":"Monto ahurisie nnwom mma no.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Onyankopɔn di ɔhene wɔ amanaman no so","poem":1},{"text":"Onyankopɔn te nʼahennwa kronkron so.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Amanaman no mu akunini boaboa wɔn ho ano","poem":1},{"text":"sɛ Abraham Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ,","poem":2},{"text":"ɛfiri sɛ asase so ahemfo yɛ Onyankopɔn dea;","poem":1},{"text":"na wɔma no so yɛ no kɛseɛ.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/twi_asa/PSA/47.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/twi_asa/PSA/48.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/twi_asa/PSA/46.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}